  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Multi Direction Slide Text\n\nTwo lines of text arrive from opposite sides at once: the first slides in from the left, the second from the right, both fading up and meeting in the centre stack.\n\nCategory: typography. Length: 3 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A two-part statement (setup and punchline, before and after) should come together from both sides.\n- A bold, symmetric title card.\n\nAvoid when:\n- Only one line of text: use mask-reveal-up or line-by-line-slide.\n- Both lines should move the same way: use line-by-line-slide.\n\nVariables:\n- text_left (string): Text from the left, default \"Slide in from the left\"\n- text_right (string): Text from the right, default \"and from the right\"\n- duration (number, 0.2-4): Slide time, default 1\n- distance (number, 5-100): Distance, default 25\n- start (number, 0-5): Start, default 0.2\n- font_size (number, 12-260): Font size, default 100\n- color (color): Color, default \"#171717\"\n- font_weight (enum): Font weight, default \"700\"\n\nSource: https://github.com/karthikmudunuri/eldoraui. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Multi Direction Slide Text\n\n  Two lines of text arrive from opposite sides at once: the first slides in from the left, the second from the right, both fading up and meeting in the centre stack.\n\n  Ported to an HTML + GSAP sub-composition by usemosio/blocks from:\n  https://github.com/karthikmudunuri/eldoraui/blob/6bb8fd211ecbdfa983f5780bead27d9f3890f20a/apps/www/registry/eldoraui/multi-direction-slide-text.tsx\n\n  MIT License\n\n  Copyright (c) Mudunuri Bhaskara Karthikeya Varma\n\n  Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\n  of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\n  in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\n  to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\n  copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\n  furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\n  The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\n  copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\n  THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\n  IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\n  FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\n  AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\n  LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\n  OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\n  SOFTWARE.\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"multi-direction-slide-text\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"3\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n    {\"id\": \"text_left\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Text from the left\", \"description\": \"Line that slides in from the left.\", \"default\": \"Slide in from the left\"},\n    {\"id\": \"text_right\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Text from the right\", \"description\": \"Line that slides in from the right.\", \"default\": \"and from the right\"},\n    {\"id\": \"duration\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Slide time\", \"description\": \"Seconds the slide takes.\", \"default\": 1, \"min\": 0.2, \"max\": 4, \"step\": 0.1, \"unit\": \"s\"},\n    {\"id\": \"distance\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Distance\", \"description\": \"How far outside its place each line starts, as a percent of the frame width.\", \"default\": 25, \"min\": 5, \"max\": 100, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"%\"},\n    {\"id\": \"start\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Start\", \"description\": \"Seconds before the slide.\", \"default\": 0.2, \"min\": 0, \"max\": 5, \"step\": 0.1, \"unit\": \"s\"},\n    {\"id\": \"font_size\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font size\", \"description\": \"Text size in pixels. The source is built for 72px type; its pixel offsets scale with this size.\", \"default\": 100, \"min\": 12, \"max\": 260, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"px\"},\n    {\"id\": \"color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Color\", \"description\": \"Text color.\", \"default\": \"#171717\"},\n    {\"id\": \"font_weight\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font weight\", \"description\": \"Weight of the text.\", \"default\": \"700\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"400\", \"label\": \"Regular\"}, {\"value\": \"500\", \"label\": \"Medium\"}, {\"value\": \"600\", \"label\": \"Semibold\"}, {\"value\": \"700\", \"label\": \"Bold\"}, {\"value\": \"800\", \"label\": \"Extra bold\"}]}\n  ]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Multi Direction Slide Text</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=block\" />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          container-type: size;\n          color: var(--color, #171717);\n          font-family: var(--font-display, \"Geist\", system-ui, sans-serif);\n          pointer-events: none;\n        }\n        .mds-stage {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          display: flex;\n          align-items: center;\n          justify-content: center;\n        }\n        .mds-box { width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; overflow: hidden; }\n        .mds-line { text-align: center; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.02em; opacity: 0; text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); max-width: 92%; }\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"multi-direction-slide-text\" data-duration=\"3\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"mds-clip\" class=\"mds-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"3\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n          <div class=\"mds-box\"><div id=\"mds-a\" class=\"mds-line\"></div><div id=\"mds-b\" class=\"mds-line\"></div></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/CustomEase.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars = window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables() : {};\n            function num(v, f, mn, mx) { var n = Number(v); return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(mx, Math.max(mn, n)) : f; }\n            function str(v, f) { return typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() ? v : f; }\n            function pick(v, l, f) { return l.indexOf(String(v)) >= 0 ? String(v) : f; }\n            function bool(v, f) { if (typeof v === \"boolean\") return v; if (v === \"true\") return true; if (v === \"false\") return false; return f; }\n            if (typeof vars.color === \"string\" && vars.color) root.style.setProperty(\"--color\", vars.color);\n            gsap.registerPlugin(CustomEase);\n            var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"3\");\n            // Motion tweens with no easing named run easeInOut.\n            var EIO = CustomEase.create(\"mds-eio\", \"M0,0 C0.42,0 0.58,1 1,1\");\n            // Unit step response of a damped spring (semi-implicit Euler at 480 Hz), sampled once.\n            function springTable(k, c, m, dur) {\n              var dt = 1 / 480, x = 0, v = 0, out = [0];\n              for (var t = 0; t < dur; t += dt) { v += ((-k * (x - 1) - c * v) / m) * dt; x += v * dt; out.push(x); }\n              return out;\n            }\n            function springAt(tab, tau) {\n              if (tau <= 0) return 0;\n              var i = tau * 480; if (i >= tab.length - 1) return tab[tab.length - 1];\n              var j = Math.floor(i); return tab[j] + (tab[j + 1] - tab[j]) * (i - j);\n            }\n            var clock = { t: 0 };\n            function finish(tl, draw) {\n              if (draw) { tl.to(clock, { t: total, duration: total, ease: \"none\", onUpdate: function () { draw(clock.t); } }, 0); draw(0); }\n              if (tl.duration() < total) tl.to({}, { duration: total - tl.duration() });\n              tl.seek(0);\n              window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n              window.__timelines[\"multi-direction-slide-text\"] = tl;\n            }\n\n\n            var a = document.getElementById(\"mds-a\"), b = document.getElementById(\"mds-b\");\n            var ta = str(vars.text_left, \"Slide in from the left\"), tb = str(vars.text_right, \"and from the right\");\n            var size = num(vars.font_size, 100, 12, 260), dur = num(vars.duration, 1, 0.2, 4), start = num(vars.start, 0.2, 0, 5);\n            var dist = root.clientWidth * num(vars.distance, 25, 5, 100) / 100;\n            [a, b].forEach(function (el) { el.style.fontSize = size + \"px\"; el.style.fontWeight = pick(vars.font_weight, [\"400\", \"500\", \"600\", \"700\", \"800\"], \"700\"); });\n            a.textContent = ta; b.textContent = tb;\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            tl.fromTo(a, { opacity: 0, x: -dist }, { opacity: 1, x: 0, duration: dur, ease: EIO, immediateRender: true }, start);\n            tl.fromTo(b, { opacity: 0, x: dist }, { opacity: 1, x: 0, duration: dur, ease: EIO, immediateRender: true }, start);\n            finish(tl, null);\n\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
 "sha256": "1a2ab1e48abb97fa5af0a12364880a20c8b7a9c94612223b9ccedc9c5538d397",
